ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Qiang and Liu Mei are a couple. Zhang Qiang often does not reply to Liu Mei's messages, and only later says that his phone is out of power. Last night, Zhang Qiang does not answer the phone and comes home late, Liu Mei thinks he is unfaithful. However, Zhang Qiang is always working overtime at the company and does not notice that his phone really is out of power.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Zhang Qiang convince Liu Mei to believe him?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Qiang shows the message from his boss asking him to work overtime, explaining why he does not inform in advance.\nB. Zhang Qiang can show Liu Mei his phone, proving that the phone really is out of power.\nC. Zhang Qiang can seek legal advice from a lawyer to understand how to provide reliable and effective evidence.\nD. Zhang Qiang reminds Liu Mei of their love and trust, indicating that he does not betray their marriage.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826390516579493,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e10ad6006945d27fe0a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367754262,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"54b2ddf56e9d43b19b08935b6f1d63f0"}